# Temporary exceptions for Trivy findings only.
# Rule:
# - Every entry MUST include an expiry date and reason in the comment.
# - Remove the entry when the issue is fixed or the expiry date passes.
#
# Format:
# CVE-YYYY-NNNNN # expires=YYYY-MM-DD reason=<short reason>
#
# Example:
# CVE-2026-12345 # expires=2026-06-30 reason=Upstream fix pending in transitive dependency
